  "prefLabel": "Pes 1002.12 Site Management Area Designation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 1002.12 Site Management Area Designation. The division, taking into consideration any information from a landowner meeting, the recommendations of the site management area committee contained in the site management area plan, and the detection of a pesticide in at least 2 samples taken at different times from a groundwater or surface water sampling point, shall designate a site management area provided the information and recommendations support the designation.\n\nSource. #5702, eff 9-17-93; ss by #6316, eff 8-13-96; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
